msgstr "ຫນ້າຕ່າງທີ່ເຮັດວຽກ (%1)"

#: useractions.cpp:1291
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The window manager is configured to consider the screen with the mouse on it "
"as active one.\n"
"Therefore it is not possible to switch to a screen explicitly."
msgstr ""
"ການຈັດການຫນ້າຕ່າງຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຈໍທີ່ເມົ້າສີຢູ່ເປັນຈໍທີ່ໃຊ້ຢູ່.\n"
"ມື້ນອັນແຕ່ນັ້ນຈະບໍ່ສາມາດສັບປ່ຽນໄປຫາຈໍໃດໆໄດ້ຢ່າງຊັດເຈນ."

#: virtualdesktops.cpp:696 virtualdesktops.cpp:767
#, kde-format
msgid "Desktop %1"
msgstr "ພື້ນທີ່ทำงาน %1"

#: virtualdesktops.cpp:802
#, kde-format
msgid "Switch to Next Desktop"
msgstr "ປ່ຽນໄປຫາ desktop ຖັດໄປ"

#: virtualdesktops.cpp:804
#, kde-format
msgid "Switch to Previous Desktop"
msgstr "ປ່ຽນໄປຫາພື້ນທີ່ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້"

#: virtualdesktops.cpp:806
#, kde-format
msgid "Switch One Desktop to the Right"
msgstr "ປ່ຽນໄປຫາພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກດານຂວາ"

#: virtualdesktops.cpp:808
#, kde-format
msgid "Switch One Desktop to the Left"
msgstr "ສະລັບໄປຫາພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກທາງຊ້າຍ"

#: virtualdesktops.cpp:810
#, kde-format
msgid "Switch One Desktop Up"
msgstr "ສະລັບໄປຕັ້ງໂຕະທາງເທິງ"

#: virtualdesktops.cpp:812
#, kde-format
msgid "Switch One Desktop Down"
msgstr "ສະລັບໄປຫາພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກທາງລຸ່ມ"

#: virtualdesktops.cpp:825
#, kde-format
msgid "Switch to Desktop %1"
msgstr "ສັບປ່ຽນໄປຫາພື້ນທີ່ %1"

#: workspace.cpp:1443
#, kde-format
msgctxt "Introductory text shown in the support information."
msgid ""
"KWin Support Information:\n"
"The following information should be used when requesting support on e.g. "
"https://forum.kde.org.\n"
"It provides information about the currently running instance, which options "
"are used,\n"
"what OpenGL driver and which effects are running.\n"
"Please post the information provided underneath this introductory text to a "
"paste bin service\n"
"like https://paste.kde.org instead of pasting into support threads.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ມູນການສະຫນັບສະຫນູນຂອງ KWin:\n"
"ຂໍ້ມູນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຄວນຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເມື່ອຂໍຄວາມຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ, ເຊັ່ນໃນ https://forum.kde.org."
"\n"
"ມັນສະແດງຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບຕົວຢ່າງທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກໃນປັດຈຸບັນ, "
"ລວມທັງທາງເລືອກໃດທີ່ຖືກໃຊ້,\n"
"ໄດເວີ OpenGL ທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານ, ແລະ ອິເຟັກຂະຫນາດໃດທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກ.\n"
"ກະລຸນາວາງຂໍ້ມູນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໄປໃນບໍລິການຄລິບບອດ,\n"
"ເຊັ່ນ https://paste.kde.org ແທນທີ່ຈະວາງມັນໂດຍກົງໃສ່ໃນບົດຄວາມຂໍຄວາມຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ."
"\n"
